        <body>
            <div xml:id="d731">

                <pb facs="0847" n="727" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg727"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State to Minister
                        Pearson.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-01-11"><hi rendition="#italic">January 11,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis instructs Mr. Pearson to inform Consul Norton that he may return as
                    soon as he wishes, as the Labaree matter has been settled.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
